{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Faced with the brink of extinction due to a sudden environmental catastrophe, humanity placed its last hope in a team of android explorers, sent into the depths of space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aboard one of these vessels, a single android has traveled alone through the cosmos for twenty long years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At last, it arrives on an uncharted planet\u2014but what awaits it there is unknown...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>cinematic sound novel</strong> that uses evocative, film-like storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay is <strong>choice-based</strong>, but there are <strong>no multiple endings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong>no restrictions on streaming or content creation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> 60\u201390 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665680?t=1745076113","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665680?t=1745076113","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665680/5f89bb6520af998ddaf18480500297c69e3bcd64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745076113","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665680/5f89bb6520af998ddaf18480500297c69e3bcd64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745076113","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Faced with the brink of extinction due to a sudden environmental catastrophe, humanity placed its last hope in a team of android explorers, sent into the depths of space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aboard one of these vessels, a single android has traveled alone through the cosmos for twenty long years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At last, it arrives on an uncharted planet\u2014but what awaits it there is unknown...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>cinematic sound novel</strong> that uses evocative, film-like storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay is <strong>choice-based</strong>, but there are <strong>no multiple endings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong>no restrictions on streaming or content creation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> 60\u201390 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Neko Plot"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665680/afefe67d9200003da79ae2be7bd3851e464a0f94/header.jpg?t=1745076113","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126302,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126302/movie480.mp4?t=1745076111","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126302/movie_max.mp4?t=1745076111"},"name":"\u5922\u306e\u7d42\u308f\u308a","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126302/d548f30d7129086bb7e6c1d5dad2f4519fa54303/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745076111","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126302/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745076111","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126302/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745076111"}}],